{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03、S13等段落的感受提示拆得过细，连续出现时容易让观众忙着追文字，反而顾不上音乐；X的右栏短词在这些地方更容易一眼掠过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮词把每段叙事的关键转折标了出来，观众更容易抓住他为什么舍不得、为什么又不敢回去，以及这些矛盾如何一步步变化；感受词又通过出现时机和具体的音乐、身体反应，把情绪落到了实际听觉经验上，而不是泛泛地贴情绪标签。尤其从S06到S13，想念、孤单、犹疑、重新站稳之间的联系更容易被感受到，最后的决定也不是突然变得积极，而是带着未消失的害怕继续生活。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "40e91f17-736e-4758-a466-19b4bcbc12fc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231140463659Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:12:19.136061+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "044db24ba10b17dbc70d57c20c9a086aa5a87eab9f9a448e700e36f5052c0dc5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w